    "enUS": {
      "description": "I've got no idea what happened to our horses. I got up one morning to feed 'em and they were all gone, just like that.\r\n\r\nLife outside Farholde's a bit rougher. Anything could've got 'em--animals, murlocs, orcs, you name it.\r\n\r\nIf we wanna narrow down our list of culprits, we oughta search around the stables for clues.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Find Clues",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Search near the stables at Wheeler's Grange for evidence of the missing horses' whereabouts.",
